// SFX — Toggle/checkbox ON (settings toggles, Public checkbox)
// Status: DONE (owner-approved 2026-07-19)
// Whisper-quiet triangle tick. Pitch carries the state: A4 = ON (up), F4 = OFF (down) —
// see sfx-toggle-off.strudel for the pair.
// Render: one hit, WAV. Audition ticks once per second.
// Paste into https://strudel.cc — spec: TDD/sound/stinger-sfx-spec.md

setcpm(60)

note("a4 ~ ~ ~").sound("triangle")
  .attack(.001).decay(.05).sustain(0).lpf(1800).gain(.32)
